; ISSUE-032: `as` refuses a narrowing and names only `unsafe/cast`, the
; unchecked escape, though `as-checked` is the checked conversion meant for an
; index known to fit.
; fixed-when: output-contains as-checked
; Actual: "as: lossy conversion from i32 to usize -- use unsafe/cast". The
; probe passes once the message mentions as-checked.

(defn index-of (x:i32):usize (return (as usize x)))
(defn main ():i32 (return (as-checked i32 (index-of 3))))
